{"id":"646631","name":"低糖奶香馒头","author":"两米阳光9","authorId":"10083606","desc":"","cover":"images/646631/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"600g"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"30g"},{"name":"牛奶","amount":"380g"},{"name":"奶粉","amount":"60g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"直接用面包机导入牛奶380g，白糖30g。","img":"images/646631/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"倒入面粉600g。","img":"images/646631/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"奶粉60g。","img":"images/646631/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"酵母5g。","img":"images/646631/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"面包机发面功能，时长为1个半小时。","img":"images/646631/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"面发好了。","img":"images/646631/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出排气，分成两半，分别搓成长条。","img":"images/646631/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"均匀切开。","img":"images/646631/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入铺好油纸的蒸盘。","img":"images/646631/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"提前烤箱保持30度左右的温度，放入生胚二次发酵20分钟。","img":"images/646631/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"发酵好了。","img":"images/646631/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"蒸18分钟。","img":"images/646631/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"时间到焖5分钟再打开蒸箱。","img":"images/646631/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"蒸好了。","img":"images/646631/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"马上转移到干爽的碟子里避免水汽。","img":"images/646631/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"浓浓的奶香，太美味了😘","img":"images/646631/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}